      "statement": "hub-marker-filter.ts's pre-'案 H' designs (案 E/F/G) buffered a marker block's body, stripped ANSI escapes, and rewrote it at the current cursor position (or dropped it entirely for DONE blocks); this corrupted the display against a CLI using an alternate-screen buffer with absolute-coordinate cell addressing (such as Claude Code's Ink UI), because the rewritten text landed on cells outside the CLI's own redraw bookkeeping and was never cleaned up by later redraws, reproduced line-for-line against real user screenshots in a 2026-08-26 replay of session logs.",
